Package: nbbbenuts
Title: Belgian Geographic Classification Converter
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Romain", "Grailet", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "romain.grailet@nbb.be")
Description: Tools to convert Belgian geographic codes between classification
    systems (NIS communes, NUTS regions, postal codes) and across time versions
    (NIS BEFORE_2019, 2019, 2025; NUTS 2021, 2027). Includes dataset-level
    conversion, weighted splitting of ambiguous M:N mappings, and classification
    diagnostics.
